<title>UK: Swiss Kantonalbanks set 500 mln Swiss franc bond.</title>
<headline>Swiss Kantonalbanks set 500 mln Swiss franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Zurcher Kantonalbank.</p>
<p>BORROWER  PFANDBRIEFZENTRALE DER SCHWEIZERISCHEN KANTONALBANKEN</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.125     MATURITY    25.NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.875   PAY DATE    25.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    =	   EOS	   31.OCT.96</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    SWX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-100-1M  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
